<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Berzack, Voltex group in talks.</title>
<headline>Berzack, Voltex group in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Berzack-Illman Investment Corp Ltd, Voltex Holdings Ltd and Berzack Brothers (Holdings) Ltd on Tuesday said they were in talks, which if successfully concluded could have an impact on the firms' share prices.</p>
<p>No further details were given except to advise shareholders to exercise caution in their share dealings.</p>
<p>Berzack-Illman owns a 50 percent stake in Berzack Bros which in turn owns a 38 percent interest in Voltex.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
